Hello all,

A snapshot of the LaTeX3 code has been submitted to CTAN. Key changes:

 - Provide 'shell' versions of modules rolled into monolithic
   expl3 so errors raised are informative
 - Tighten up input processing for \int_to_... functions
 - Allow for catcode 6 fp operators when using LuaTeX
  (works around a current LuaTeX issue)
 -Various documentation improvements

l3build
-------

 - Allow for another LuaTeX bug during normalisation
 - Remove public "unpack" target (was historical)
 - Produce TDS-style zip as part of "ctan" target on an opt-in
   basis

Please give it around 48 h for the new code to propagate around CTAN.
